tip.pridefurniture.storage=Storage.
tip.pridefurniture.fridge=Keeps your food. The freezer turns water buckets into ice.
tip.pridefurniture.sink=Right-click with a bucket or bottle for water, or empty-handed to wash. Sneak to open the cupboard.
tip.pridefurniture.vanity=A sink with a cupboard: water for buckets and bottles, washes dye out of leather.
tip.pridefurniture.dishwasher=Fills empty bottles with water and washes dye out of leather armor.
tip.pridefurniture.compactor=Crushes whatever you put in. Every 64 items becomes a Trash Cube.
tip.pridefurniture.stove=Cooks any raw food, 4 at a time. No fuel needed.
tip.pridefurniture.hood=Right-click to turn the light on and off.
tip.pridefurniture.microwave=Heats food fast. Ding!
tip.pridefurniture.toaster=Bread → Toast.
tip.pridefurniture.coffee=Cocoa beans + a water bottle → coffee (Speed + Haste).
tip.pridefurniture.blender=Fruit or veggies → smoothie.
tip.pridefurniture.kettle=Water bottle → tea.
tip.pridefurniture.fruit=Right-click for a piece of fruit every 5 minutes.
tip.pridefurniture.trash=Right-click with anything in your hand to throw it away.
tip.pridefurniture.seat=Right-click to sit.
tip.pridefurniture.toilet=Sit, then right-click again to go. Sneak to stand up and flush.
tip.pridefurniture.tub=Right-click to fill, again to get in. Heals and cleans you.
tip.pridefurniture.shower=Right-click to turn on, then stand in it to get clean.
tip.pridefurniture.mirror=How do you look?
tip.pridefurniture.towel=Dry off after a shower.
tip.pridefurniture.washer=Washes dye out of leather, wool and carpet.
tip.pridefurniture.dryer=Dries wet sponges.
tip.pridefurniture.screen=Right-click: power. Sneak + right-click: next GIF. Add your own GIFs in config/pridefurniture/screens.
tip.pridefurniture.books=Holds books. Powers enchanting tables like a bookshelf.
tip.pridefurniture.lamp=Right-click to switch it on and off.
tip.pridefurniture.fireplace=Cozy light and warmth. Stand near it to get warm.
tip.pridefurniture.clock=Right-click to check the time.
tip.pridefurniture.globe=Give it a spin.
tip.pridefurniture.tank=Fish! They swim around in there.
tip.pridefurniture.workbench=Where all Pride furniture is made.
tip.pridefurniture.stairs=Walk round and up. Stack them: each one turns to continue the spiral.
tip.pridefurniture.scale=Step on it… well, right-click it.

